  "Touken Clan remnants are attacking people randomly around Rakunai.": "刀剣一家の残党が洛内で、\n無差別に人を襲っているらしい。",
  "Men in tengu masks are lounging and drinking and being a nuisance.": "天狗面の男が肩を落として\n酒を飲んでいる。",
  "Men in tengu masks are causing a disturbance at a restaurant in Umekojicho.": "天狗面をかぶった男たちが\n梅小路町の飲食店で\n暴れている。",
  "Men in tengu masks are looking for someone around Mukurogai.": "天狗面をかぶった男たちが\n骸街周辺で、\nある男を探し回っているらしい。",
  "Word arrived to the Tachibanagumi—Saito is to come to the riverbed near Rakugai alone.": "斎藤宛に洛外の川辺に\n一人で来いと橘組に\n伝言が有り。",
  "Street killings have occurred around Umekojicho. Requesting immediate investigation.": "梅小路町付近で辻斬りが発生。\n至急、調査されたし。",
  "The Jozo Tengu leader is waiting for Saito at the shrine in Rakunai.": "洛内の神社前で浄僧天狗頭領が\n斎藤を待っているらしい。",
  "A ninja in white has been robbing people near South Fushimi Ichibangai.": "白い忍者が伏見一番街南周辺で\n盗みを働いているらしい。",
  "Escort Inabara Akumi to Shikokuya safely.": "稲原阿久水を四国屋周辺まで\n無事に届けてほしい。",
  "Green ninja have been robbing people near Teramachi.": "緑の忍者が寺町周辺で\n盗みを働いているらしい。",
  "Secure the leader of the Chivalrous Shinobi, and his sister, at their hideout.": "義賊忍盗の隠れ家にて、\n頭領とその妹を確保せよ。",
  "Take down the Touken Clan.": "至急、刀剣一家を制圧されたし。",
  "Street killings have occurred around Kuramachi. Requesting immediate investigation.": "蔵町付近で辻斬りが発生。\n至急、調査されたし。",
  "A red ninja has been robbing people near Fushimi Ichibangai.": "赤い忍者が伏見一番街周辺で\n盗みを働いているらしい。",
  "A group of blue ninja have been robbing people around Fushimi Ichibangai.": "青い忍者が伏見一番街周辺で\n集団で盗みを働いているらしい。",
